{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9c7a8e4d-0000-4000-8000-neoc-tms-coll1",
    "name": "NEOC TMS API",
    "description": "Internal DevTeam Ops System for NEOC. Express + PostgreSQL REST API.\n\nFlow: run `Auth / Login` first — its test script auto-saves `token`, `user_id`, and `role_id` into the active environment so every subsequent request authenticates automatically. Most endpoints are role-gated (1=Admin, 2=Project Manager, 3=Developer).\n\nPath-param IDs (`{{project_id}}`, `{{task_id}}`, `{{entry_id}}`, `{{request_id}}`, `{{target_user_id}}`) live in the environment — populate them either via the auto-capture scripts on create requests or by hand.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
